.envrc
CLAUDE.md
# scripts/ is whitelist-only: activate-agent.sh / update-cookies.sh / env.local
# carry the VM's origin IP (hidden behind Cloudflare) and must never reach the
# public repo, even via a careless `git add -A`.
scripts/*
!scripts/manifest-publish.sh
!scripts/publish.env.example
!scripts/env.local.example
